  "title": "nettrace_3gpp_32_423: Deduplicate session tag lookup in read functions",
  "description": "Extract nettrace_update_session_from_buffer() helper that searches for\na <traceRecSession> tag in a buffer range and calls the session parser.\n\nBoth nettrace_read() and nettrace_seek_read() had identical 5-line\nblocks doing the same g_strstr_len + length calculation + parse call.\nNow each is a single one-liner calling the shared helper.\n\nAI-Assisted: yes (Kiro)",
